[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025754\">7025A22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025460\">5050B10</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p>1. Disconnect the pipe from the windscreen washer jets.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005501.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Remove the crest mount.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005502.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the parts to be\nrefitted are undamaged.</p><p>Position the crest mount and secure with\nbolts.</p><p>Position the windscreen wiper pipe.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025460\">5050B10</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025754\">7025A22</a></p>"]]